 Built from Mesa main (git 681ce7c2b8e) natively on aarch64 for the Adreno 830
 (gen8) in the OnePlus Pad 3. Installed under /opt so it never shadows the
 system Mesa (the stock Mesa cannot be removed: mesa-libgallium and
