Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Switchable CPU+GPU thermal profiles for the OnePlus Pad 3 (erhai)
 erhai-thermal.sh applies die-temperature ceilings to both the CPU and GPU
 thermal planes (profile selected via /etc/default/erhai-thermal), with a
 template unit (erhai-thermal@.service) for per-profile instances and a polkit
 ruleset so the desktop user can switch profiles without a password. The
 erhai-thermal@erhai.local GNOME Shell extension exposes profile switching in
 the quick settings.

